                <pb facs="0105" n="21" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg21"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Jackson to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States.</hi><lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Sofia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-09-19"><hi rendition="#italic">September 19,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Jackson reports the presentation of his letters on September 19, and states
                    that the Prince of Bulgaria expressed pleasure at the establishment of direct
                    diplomatic relations, and hopes that increased commercial intercourse will
                    result.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
